class.description:
A [PCKBuildPlan] is returned by [method PCKPackageExporter.plan_description]. It tells how [PCKPackageExporter] builds the entries of one [PCKPackage] description, without building anything: which [code]res://[/code] sources go through the export pipeline, which files are copied as they are, which paths are written as removals, which [code].import[/code], [code].remap[/code] and [code].uid[/code] entries are skipped, and which entries can't be built. It is read-only after creation.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var plan := PCKPackageExporter.plan_description(description)
if not plan.valid:
	for message in plan.errors:
		push_error(message)
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
PckBuildPlan plan = PckPackageExporter.PlanDescription(description);
if (!plan.Valid)
{
	foreach (string message in plan.Errors)
	{
		GD.PushError(message);
	}
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
[b]Note:[/b] This class is only available in editor builds.
